# ============================================================
#  .gitignore  -  Macro Displacement replication repository
# ============================================================

# --- Raw and worker-level microdata (not committed) -----------------
# The CPS is public-domain US government data, but the full IPUMS-CPS
# extracts are far too large for GitHub. The repository includes the
# IPUMS extract codebooks so the extracts can be reconstructed at no
# cost from cps.ipums.org. The constructed analysis panels and the
# public BLS / O*NET / FRED inputs ARE tracked. See README.md.
*.dat
*.dat.gz
*.parquet

# --- Generated results: keep only results/robustness/ ---------------
/results/*
!/results/robustness/

# --- LaTeX build artifacts ------------------------------------------
*.aux
*.bbl
*.blg
*.log
*.out
*.toc
*.nav
*.snm
*.abs
*.synctex.gz
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk
Tex/*.pdf

# --- Bulky Elsevier template bundle ---------------------------------
# The 3 class files needed to compile are copied into Tex/ and tracked;
# the full template bundle is not.
Tex/els-cas-templates/

# --- Local-only material (not for distribution) ---------------------
archive/
Citation Papers/
AUDIT_*.md
*AUDIT*.md
CONSISTENCY_AUDIT_*.md
PRESUBMISSION_REVIEW.md
*_REVIEW.md
*REVIEW*.md
.vscode/

# --- Python / OS cruft ----------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
